```console
$ scherzo-cloud account deletion cancel --help
Cancel account deletion

Usage: scherzo-cloud account deletion cancel [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json                 Emit newline-delimited JSON events
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

Proof:
  This command starts a fresh browser sign-in for the same linked identity.
  The proof is sent only as the cancellation bearer and is not stored as a local session.

```
